undertaken by members of the Society of Brilliance in the early 1490s DR, as told by the troglodyte Skriss, including the story of Ghazrim's Ring. Dedicated to the families of the members who ventured bravely in pursuit of knowledge and never returned. Published in the original Undercommon. Later translated to Common.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715021533\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1856/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33288/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8543/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930745/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.784      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.784      1 -total\n 56.04%   23.975      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.49%   21.172     19 Template:Trim\n 21.98%    9.405      2 Template:Uid\n 16.20%    6.931      1 Template:Main_only\n 15.09%    6.456      3 Template:Icon_link\n 12.65%    5.414      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.54%    4.509      1 Template:Ifexist\n 10.26%    4.391      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31696-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715021533 and revision id 361644. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}